{
	"name": "反省足枷凳",
	"cast": {
		"princess": {
			"kind": "princess",
			"at": [
				0,
				6
			],
			"visual": "normal",
			"anim": "idle",
			"dir": "down"
		},
		"stool": {
			"kind": "trap:stocks",
			"at": [
				0,
				12
			]
		}
	},
	"steps": [
		{
			"act": 1,
			"actions": [
				{
					"time": 0.5,
					"do": "fade_in"
				},
				{
					"state": "giggle",
					"do": "voice"
				}
			],
			"wait": 0.5
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（一张矮矮的木凳，前面竖着一块带两个半圆缺口的木板。木板上刻着一行字：「坐下，说出你的错」）",
			"act": 1
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……说出你的错？我没有错。",
			"emotion": "angry"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "坐一下又不会怎么样。我就坐着，什么都不说，它能拿我怎么样。",
			"emotion": "angry"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她刚坐下，木板「咔哒」一声落下来，正好扣住了两只脚踝。鞋子被轻轻一顶，掉在了地上）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"sound": "stocks",
					"volume": -4.0,
					"do": "sfx"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"time": 0.3,
					"do": "shake"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "诶！？扣、扣住了！？",
			"emotion": "surprise"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（木板底下伸出一把小小的软刷，在她的脚心上「沙」地刷了一下，又停住了。像是在等她说话）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "lines",
					"repeat": 3,
					"interval": 0.3,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……哼。我才不说。",
			"emotion": "angry"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（刷子又「沙沙」刷了两下——比刚才快了一点）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "lines",
					"repeat": 5,
					"interval": 0.22,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "giggle",
					"do": "pose"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……呜。不说话也刷？那、那我说：「我没错！」",
			"emotion": "angry"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（刷子一下子快了一档，从脚跟一路刷到脚尖，再从脚尖刷回脚跟）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "lines",
					"repeat": 10,
					"interval": 0.16,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			],
			"act": 2
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "噫……！说、说了也刷！？这凳子不讲道理！",
			"emotion": "giggle"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（又快了一档。第二把刷子从木板另一边伸出来，专门去拨她的脚趾缝）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "brush",
					"repeat": 12,
					"interval": 0.14,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "（……原、原来是……嘴硬一句……就快一档……！）",
			"emotion": "giggle"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "那、那我不说了！一句都不说了……！",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_1",
					"do": "pose"
				},
				{
					"do": "voice",
					"state": "laugh"
				}
			],
			"emotion": "helpless_1"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她紧紧闭上嘴。刷子慢了下来，慢得要命——一根一根刷毛，慢慢地划过脚心最软的那一块）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "feather",
					"repeat": 8,
					"interval": 0.3,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "（……慢、慢慢刷……比快的还……！）",
			"emotion": "helpless_1"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她憋得肩膀直抖。脚趾蜷起来又张开，张开又蜷起来，刷子就趁着张开的时候钻进缝里）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "brush",
					"repeat": 10,
					"interval": 0.22,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			],
			"act": 3
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……臭……臭队长……！",
			"emotion": "helpless_1"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（这一句骂出口，两把刷子同时快到了最高档）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "lines",
					"repeat": 16,
					"interval": 0.1,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_2",
					"do": "pose"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "噗——哈哈哈！不算！刚才那句不算——哈哈哈哈！",
			"emotion": "helpless_2"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（「不算」也是嘴硬。刷子又快了一点点。她仰着头笑，两只脚在木板的缺口里扭来扭去，可怎么也抽不出来）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "lines",
					"repeat": 16,
					"interval": 0.1,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "我、我错了！我错了行了吧——哈哈哈哈！",
			"emotion": "helpless_2"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（刷子停了半秒……像是在想这句是不是真心的。然后又刷了起来）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "brush",
					"repeat": 12,
					"interval": 0.12,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "它听得出来——！它听得出来我不是真心的——哈哈哈！",
			"emotion": "helpless_2"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（憋不住的笑声和魔力一起往上涌，越积越多，越积越多——）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "lines",
					"repeat": 14,
					"interval": 0.1,
					"do": "tickle"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "（星光一下子炸开，把木板都震得「嗡嗡」响……哈啊……全放出去了……脚底下暖洋洋的……好舒服……）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"time": 0.5,
					"do": "flash"
				},
				{
					"sound": "star_burst",
					"do": "sfx"
				},
				{
					"sound": "water_release",
					"volume": -2.0,
					"do": "sfx"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"time": 0.4,
					"do": "shake"
				},
				{
					"state": "laugh",
					"do": "voice"
				}
			],
			"act": "burst",
			"wait": 1.0
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（可木板没有松开。刷子抖了抖身上的星光，贴上了刚释放完、敏感得发烫的脚心）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "feather",
					"repeat": 10,
					"interval": 0.16,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_2",
					"do": "pose"
				}
			],
			"act": 4
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "呀啊……！放、放完以后……轻轻一下就……！",
			"emotion": "helpless_2"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（刷子不急不慢，在脚心正中央画着小圈，画完一个，又在趾根上画一个）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "feather",
					"repeat": 14,
					"interval": 0.13,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"do": "pose",
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_2"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……哈哈……哈……不嘴硬了……一句都不说了……让、让我歇一下……",
			"emotion": "helpless_2"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她安安静静地笑着，一句硬话都没说。刷子终于慢下来，「咔」地缩回了木板底下，枷板也抬起来了）",
			"actions": [
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"by": "stool",
					"zone": "sole",
					"fx": "feather",
					"repeat": 4,
					"interval": 0.3,
					"do": "tickle"
				},
				{
					"who": "princess",
					"visual": "helpless_1",
					"do": "pose"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"speaker": "",
			"text": "（她抱着膝盖坐在凳子上，揉了好半天脚心，才把鞋穿回去）"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……哈……哈……这凳子……是队长做的吧。一模一样的不讲道理。",
			"emotion": "sad"
		},
		{
			"speaker": "公主",
			"text": "……不过。我才不会认错。……小声说的，它听不见。",
			"emotion": "angry"
		},
		{
			"actions": [
				{
					"state": "",
					"do": "voice"
				},
				{
					"time": 0.6,
					"do": "fade_out"
				}
			],
			"wait": 0.7
		}
	]
}
